### Case: client-sends-supplier-key — a client tries to pick the supplier key.
### Expect 200, and the backend sees only the configured x-supplier-key:
### "set" replaces the client's value instead of adding to it.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/forecast
X-Api-Key: {{APP_API_KEY}}
X-Supplier-Key: client-chosen-value
accept: application/json
